> ALSA sound/pci/hda/hda_codec.c:4378:    inputs: mic=0x18, fmic=0x0,
> line=0x1c, fline=0x0, cd=0x0, aux=0x0
> ALSA sound/pci/hda/patch_realtek.c:1287: realtek: No valid SSID,
